From: Harshit Gupta <39994376+arelyx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 19:20:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 75/76] mesa: GLES implementation color read type is
 UNSIGNED_BYTE on big-endian

The big-endian A8R8G8B8 case returned GL_UNSIGNED_INT_8_8_8_8_REV for
glamor, but that is not an OpenGL ES type (dEQP state_query
implementation_color_read). Keep it for desktop GL; glamor's GLES
format check accepts BGRA/UNSIGNED_BYTE on big-endian instead
(xorg/glamor-be-gles.patch).

Generated-by: LLM
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QFJdrUq9L8NDS5PyGFCsG9
---
 src/mesa/main/framebuffer.c | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/mesa/main/framebuffer.c b/src/mesa/main/framebuffer.c
index 1cade69..acf32ed 100644
--- a/src/mesa/main/framebuffer.c
+++ b/src/mesa/main/framebuffer.c
@@ -989,7 +989,10 @@ _mesa_get_color_read_type(struct gl_context *ctx,
        * which is what glamor asks for (Xbox 360) */
       if (format == MESA_FORMAT_A8R8G8B8_UNORM || format == MESA_FORMAT_X8R8G8B8_UNORM ||
           format == MESA_FORMAT_B8G8R8A8_UNORM || format == MESA_FORMAT_B8G8R8X8_UNORM)
-         return GL_UNSIGNED_INT_8_8_8_8_REV;   /* (any type is converted; this one is glamor's) */
+         /* (any type is converted; this one is glamor's). OpenGL ES has no
+          * 8_8_8_8_REV: BGRA/UNSIGNED_BYTE there (dEQP state_query
+          * implementation_color_read) */
+         return _mesa_is_desktop_gl(ctx) ? GL_UNSIGNED_INT_8_8_8_8_REV : GL_UNSIGNED_BYTE;
 #endif
       return _mesa_uncompressed_format_to_type(format);
    }
